+ * follows strings and braces only, cuts out each record and hands it to
+ * SEOProStack_Vulnerability_Feed_Matcher. It stops between records when
+ * time runs out and gives the byte offset to go on from, so a check can run
+ * in parts.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+ * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Marcus Quinn
+ * Additional terms (GPL-3.0 section 7(b)): SEOPROSTACK-ATTRIBUTION.txt
